  m_Name: Carta_ZoneamentoDeUsoMisto
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Zoneamento de Uso Misto
  _titleEn: Mixed-Use Zoning
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Misturar moradia, com\xE9rcio e servi\xE7os no mesmo bairro deixa as
    ruas movimentadas o dia todo. Jane Jacobs chamou isso de olhos na rua, em 1961:
    gente circulando inibe o crime."
  _summaryEn: 'Mixing homes, shops and services in the same neighborhood keeps streets
    busy all day. Jane Jacobs called it eyes on the street in 1961: people around
    deter crime.'
  _realWorld: "A cidade de 15 minutos, adotada por Paris desde 2020, prop\xF5e que
    moradia, trabalho, escola e lazer fiquem a 15 minutos a p\xE9 ou de bicicleta."
  _realWorldEn: The 15-minute city, adopted by Paris since 2020, proposes that home,
    work, school and leisure be within 15 minutes on foot or by bike.
  _tradeOffs: "Misturar usos gera conflitos de vizinhan\xE7a, como barulho, e pode
    valorizar o bairro a ponto de expulsar moradores."
  _tradeOffsEn: Mixing uses causes neighbor conflicts such as noise, and can raise
    property values enough to push residents out.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Jane Jacobs (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jane_Jacobs
  - Label: 15-minute city (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/15-minute_city
  - Label: Moreno et al. (2021), Smart Cities
    Url: https://doi.org/10.3390/smartcities4010006
